OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer urges shops to buy British
OL,4,Astrawberries
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The autumn hopefully should make up
OL,7,Ffor some of the difficult parts of the
OL,8,Fseason we've had so far," Rendall said.
